How about wishing for a non-artefact form of reflection?  There is a 50% 
chance of there being an amulet of reflection in Sokoban, so I think a 
helm of brilliance would be a good idea.

Or you could wish for a non-artefact form of MR, such as a CoMR, but 
taking off a robe and putting on a new one takes longer than changing 
your helm.

Another, potentially more useful, form of escape is a /oDig.  And of 
course there is the one that doesn't require a wish, which is to read 
the unknown spellbook and hope it teleports you (not very reliable, alas).

Failing that, wish for a /oDeath and zap back, or even just try meleeing 
the centaur.  I don't know how well monks do with weapons, but you might 
be able to kill him before he kills you.

